urceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15912","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126897","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44387","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114307","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"407852","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"54066","synopsis":"Mikado and Hiyakawa go to investigate a pond at a house. Their client, the woman who owns the house, has the same dream every night of a corpse floating in the pond. Mikado dives down into the pond to have a look, and there at the bottom, in the murk, he sees its core. On their way home that day, Mikado and Hiyakawa stop to eat and Hiura Erika appears before them. Erika reveals to the two of them that she is a curse peddler and a necromancer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y0xuI2TvZDejCqQdGmuVEPWA6Dk.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Mikado and Hiyakawa go to investigate a pond at a house. Their client, the woman who owns the house, has the same dream every night of a corpse floating in the pond. Mikado dives down into the pond to have a look, and there at the bottom, in the murk, he sees its core. On their way home that day, Mikado and Hiyakawa stop to eat and Hiura Erika appears before them. Erika reveals to the two of them that she is a curse peddler and a necromancer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y0xuI2TvZDejCqQdGmuVEPWA6Dk.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15912","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126897","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44387","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114307","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"407852","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"54385","synopsis":"At the request of police detective Hanzawa, Mikado visits an empty storefront. Hanzawa says that kamikakushi—paranormal disappearances—are often reported of that spot. When Mikado phones Hiyakawa, who is still back at the office, from in front of the vacant store, Hiyakawa possesses Mikado's body and begins investigating the abandoned shop. He realizes that the store has been turned into a kind of savings box to store bad things and that it had been created by Erika at the request of a mysterious figure.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6D2KXSuyozGQmcqo6S6uOZInfwn.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"At the request of police detective Hanzawa, Mikado visits an empty storefront. Hanzawa says that kamikakushi—paranormal disappearances—are often reported of that spot. When Mikado phones Hiyakawa, who is still back at the office, from in front of the vacant store, Hiyakawa possesses Mikado's body and begins investigating the abandoned shop. He realizes that the store has been turned into a kind of savings box to store bad things and that it had been created by Erika at the request of a mysterious figure.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6D2KXSuyozGQmcqo6S6uOZInfwn.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15912","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126897","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44387","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114307","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"407852","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"54622","synopsis":"Hiyakawa can't understand what Mikado is feeling. And for his part, while Mikado recognizes how deviant Hiyakawa is, he just can't cut ties with him. In the middle of all this, Mikado is as good as kidnapped by Sakaki and taken to Erika in a car. Erika asks a bewildered Mikado for help with her homework, as though the situation were quite normal. As Erika works on her homework, she tells Mikado about the mysterious man who employs her and about how her powers awakened.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q0LC7YFRFNcyuuaFAJ2KHqEv21J.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Hiyakawa can't understand what Mikado is feeling. And for his part, while Mikado recognizes how deviant Hiyakawa is, he just can't cut ties with him. In the middle of all this, Mikado is as good as kidnapped by Sakaki and taken to Erika in a car. Erika asks a bewildered Mikado for help with her homework, as though the situation were quite normal. As Erika works on her homework, she tells Mikado about the mysterious man who employs her and about how her powers awakened.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q0LC7YFRFNcyuuaFAJ2KHqEv21J.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15912","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126897","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44387","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114307","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"407852","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"54752","synopsis":"While visiting a member of a bereaved family, Hanzawa remembers the first time he met Hiyakawa. It was over a decade ago and Hiyakawa had been a child then. He'd said that he'd seen many people destroyed by the power of belief and that he believed that he would one day encounter a destiny meant just for him. When he was young, after his mother had discovered his abilities, Hiyakawa had been placed in a symbolic position within a special group called the Palm of the Hand Research Society.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c1hYzvLd9E2my0bmR8z1mY1Z2BL.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"While visiting a member of a bereaved family, Hanzawa remembers the first time he met Hiyakawa. It was over a decade ago and Hiyakawa had been a child then. He'd said that he'd seen many people destroyed by the power of belief and that he believed that he would one day encounter a destiny meant just for him. When he was young, after his mother had discovered his abilities, Hiyakawa had been placed in a symbolic position within a special group called the Palm of the Hand Research Society.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c1hYzvLd9E2my0bmR8z1mY1Z2BL.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15912","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126897","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44387","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114307","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"407852","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"54849","synopsis":"Hanzawa's wife has fallen ill due to Erika's curse. Though Mikado knows it was her work, his conscience won't let him tell Hanzawa anything. Erika and Sakaki raid COOLEAN. They hold Mikado down and interrogate him, asking \"Why did you talk to the police?\" Erika goes out of control and curses her own existence, poisoning herself.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j5PPjr5e72OvGAl3ssuyxYYsFMC.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Hanzawa's wife has fallen ill due to Erika's curse. Though Mikado knows it was her work, his conscience won't let him tell Hanzawa anything. Erika and Sakaki raid COOLEAN. They hold Mikado down and interrogate him, asking \"Why did you talk to the police?\" Erika goes out of control and curses her own existence, poisoning herself.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j5PPjr5e72OvGAl3ssuyxYYsFMC.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15912","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"126897","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44387","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"114307","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"407852","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"55092","synopsis":"In order to learn more about Sensei's movements, Mikado and Hiyakawa make a plan to astral project into his house with the help of Mukae, Erika, and Sakaki. But they discover that Sensei's house was built on the site where the Palm of the Hand Research Society used to stand. Mikado recommends that they call off their plan out of concern for Hiyakawa, but Hiyakawa calmly replies \"I won't remember. I never forgot.\"","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nLH2Rshcd8bN9cRIYAqUy8K8zNJ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"In order to learn more about Sensei's movements, Mikado and Hiyakawa make a plan to astral project into his house with the help of Mukae, Erika, and Sakaki. But they discover that Sensei's house was built on the site where the Palm of the Hand Research Society used to stand. Mikado recommends that they call off their plan out of concern for Hiyakawa, but Hiyakawa calmly replies \"I won't remember. I never forgot.\"","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nLH2Rshcd8bN9cRIYAqUy8K8zNJ.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15912","sc